# RFC 9116 puts security.txt at /.well-known/security.txt. The file ships from
# website/static/ and lands at the site root, so serve it at the canonical path
# with a rewrite rather than shipping two copies that can drift apart.
# Netlify reads this file from the published directory, which is what the CI
# `netlify deploy --dir=website/dist` uses.
/.well-known/security.txt   /security.txt   200
